d is effortless. Just log in or register, and you'll gain access to a curated library of immersive yoga sessions, each set in breathtaking virtual environments. These guided practices are perfect for all skill levels, whether you're a beginner exploring the basics or an experienced yogi deepening your practice.\n\nAtmos Yoga offers a unique blend of mindfulness and technology, allowing you to disconnect from stress and reconnect with your inner self. Transport yourself to stunning landscapes, follow expert-led instructions, and embrace a truly immersive way to practice yoga\u2014all within the comfort of your VR headset.\n\nStep into a new world of tranquility and wellness. Download Atmos Yoga today and start your VR yoga journey!\n\n", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a peaceful yoga journey with Atmos Yoga, featuring a collection of 360\u00b0 yoga videos designed to help you relax, meditate, and improve flexibility in a stunning virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lnk.bio/AtmosYoga", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rcade LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lnk.bio/AtmosYoga", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9848138545231927"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "983939207